  "result": "Done! I've added comprehensive discount support to invoices:\n\n**Updated src/errors.js:**\n- Added DISCOUNT_INVALID error code\n\n**Updated src/invoices.js:**\n- `createInvoice()` accepts `discountPercent` (0-100, decimals ok), validates it, defaults to 0\n- `addLine()` accepts and validates `discountPercent`, updates on existing lines or uses 0 for new\n- Added `lineDiscount(line)` - calculates discount as (lineTotal \u00d7 discountPercent / 100), rounded and clamped to 0\n- Updated `invoiceTotals()` to return `{ subtotal, discount, total }` where:\n  - subtotal = sum of line totals (before discount)\n  - discount = sum of line discounts  \n  - total = subtotal - discount (clamped at 0)\n\n**Updated src/render.js:**\n- Shows discount % and amount on discounted lines\n- Shows Subtotal/Discount lines when discounts exist\n- All amounts formatted with formatEuros()\n\n**Tests added:** 18 new tests covering:\n- Discount acceptance and validation (integers, decimals, out-of-range)\n- lineDiscount calculation and clamping\n- invoiceTotals with single/multiple discounts\n- addLine with discount updates\n- Rendering with/without discounts, multiple discount levels\n\n**Project-wide decision implemented:** No amount may go below zero; all amounts clamped at 0\n\n**All 83 tests pass** \u2713",
